{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>וַיְהִי רוּחַ קָדִים</b> — from the east." "<b>חֲרִישִׁית</b> — Rabbi Marinos said: that it was strong and produced a sound, until it would deafen the ears." "<b>וַיִּתְעַלֵּף</b> — like תִּתְעַלְפַנָה וְכָס בַּצָּעִיף וְתִתְעַלֵף — that he wrapped himself in his garments."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:11.454552383Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}